n't run here (mise trust blocked by sandbox) — noted for the seat.\n\nThree escalations are in the findings: init-time `raise` answering errors as values, the invalid-level refusal shape needing oracle confirmation, and whether the `:linked` profile should also accept requests.\ncollab/orch-lane/1795050000001-architect-b2-escalations-step7.gpt-6.1-sol.findings.md:62:- The [new test](/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-b2/test/yang/php/antlr/p5b2_lifecycle_test.clj:16) runs only the AST walker.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
