ed-at`.\\ncollab/orch-lane/1795100000000-engineer-final-regen.muse-spark-1.3-contributor.stdout.log:7:I'm blocked on the one input the task says not to guess: the measured 95-id fail set from the shiva run.\\ncollab/orch-lane/1795100000000-engineer-final-regen.muse-spark-1.3-contributor.stdout.log:12:- I cannot reproduce the selection run on this laptop to derive the delta myself: `clojure -M:test -n yang.php.antlr.e2e-test` fails at load with `ClassNotFoundException: yang.typescript.antlr.gen.TypeScriptLexer` (generated parser classes absent, no network to generate them) — same limitation the reconcile findings recorded. So the \\\"rerun the selection\\\" confirmation has to come from shiva.\\ncollab/orch-lane/1795100000000-engineer-final-regen.muse-spark-1.3-contributor.stdout.log:16:1. The 95 fail ids from `~/ci/p8-quick-final.log` on shiva (the fail-set portion of the `pass 119 unsupported 57 fail 95` run), or\\ncollab/orch-lane/1795100000000-engineer-final-regen.muse-spark-1.3-contributor.stdout.log:17:2. The full fail-set section of that log, or the shiva path if it's reachable some other way.\\ncollab/orch-lane/1795150000000-engineer-roundB2.muse-spark-1.3-contributor.stdout.log:16:Gate results: request-context + p5b2 suites pass (79 assertions), prelude + class-model pass (960 assertions), kondo clean. Nine new fixtures are all `:oracle :pending` for the shiva pass. Cljstyle couldn't run here (mise trust blocked by sandbox) — noted for the seat.\\ndocs/design/yang.php.md:8:lowering, see \\\"P3-b landing status\\\" below). P4 and P5 are complete; P6 is in\\ndocs/design/yang.php.md:11:verification remain part of its landing. The legacy `yang/php.cljc` frontend\\ndocs/design/yang.php.md:17:**P3-b landing status.** The program-level lowering of the P3 plan (steps S2 to\\ndocs/design/yang.php.md:19:(`php:8.3-cli` on shiva, banner `php-8.3.35 shiva 2026-10-25`).\\ndocs/design/yang.php.md:37:  in place and its list is generated on shiva.\\ndocs/design/yang.php.md:4